{"headword":"שֵׂעָר","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong><a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.3\">Lv 13:3</a> <strong>hair</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:25\" href=\"/Genesis.25.25\">Gn 25:25</a> +, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂעַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:22\" href=\"/Judges.16.22\">Ju 16:22</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׂ֫עַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.20\">Is 7:20</a> (Ges<sup>§ 93 hh</sup> Kö<sup>ii. 1. 78</sup>); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂעָרֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.7\">Ez 16:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׂעֲרֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:1\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.1\">Ct 4:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:5\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.5\">6:5</a> (Kö<sup>l.c.</sup>); <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂעָרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:8\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.8\">Lv 14:8</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂעָרָהּ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.20\">20</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂעָרָהֿ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.4\">4</a> (Ges<sup>§ 91 e</sup>);—<em>hair:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"of animals, as material, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַדֶּרֶת שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:25\" href=\"/Genesis.25.25\">Gn 25:25</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 13:4\" href=\"/Zechariah.13.4\">Zc 13:4</a>; prob. also <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ בַּעַל שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.1.8\">2 K 1:8</a> i.e. a man with a garment of skin."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"human: <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳ רֹאשׁוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:22\" href=\"/Judges.16.22\">Ju 16:22</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 14:26\" href=\"/II_Samuel.14.26\">2 S 14:26</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:5\" href=\"/Numbers.6.5\">Nu 6:5</a> (P), cf. v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:18\" href=\"/Numbers.6.18\">18</a> (P); + beard <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:3\" href=\"/Ezra.9.3\">Ezr 9:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">קָדְקֹד שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:22\" href=\"/Psalms.68.22\">ψ 68:22</a>; incl. head, beard, eyebrows <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:8\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.8\">Lv 14:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.10\">10</a> (P); <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳ הָרַגְלַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.20\">Is 7:20</a> (i.e. of genitals; + <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹאשׁ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זָקָן</span>; in fig.) long <em>hair</em> of woman <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.7\">Ez 16:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:1\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.1\">Ct 4:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:5\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.5\">6:5</a>; <em>hair</em> of skin in (leprosy-) marks <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.3\">Lv 13:3</a> + 10 times <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.13\">13</a> (P)."}],"num":"2."}]},"rid":"BDB09744","strong_numbers":["8181"],"next_hw":"שַׂעֲרָה","prev_hw":"שׂער","occurrences":"27","quotes":[],"GK":["8552"],"TWOT":["2274a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}